EncryptThenTag/Forgery: identical until bad between the experiments without and
with the rejection of fresh pairs (random tag function), and the bad
probability q/2^{2n} by induction with the tag function overridden on the
revealed pairs. EncryptThenTag.lean: cca_rej_step.
